    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/813ec476d12e952483f7307fb3362124.webp?t=1739746637\" width=615 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ancient artefact has been tampered with and left in ruins. A lone hero is tasked by a mysterious occult with restoring it's power. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Of The Stars</strong> is a Momentum-based Collectathon. You play as Stoney, an explorer tasked with gathering all the Power Orbs. Jump, spin and bounce through a large variety of open-ended ethereal worlds to discover the secrets behind an ancient force which others seek to destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/4f08823ce172bcd0f4ed07cf2de8fdd5.webp?t=1739746637\" width=615 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0 Multiple playable characters - With varying stats and unique moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0 Simple and accessible controls - Whilst offering tons of movement tricks for more experienced players to take advantage of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A variety of worlds and locations to explore - From small sun-soaked islands to broad cityscapes to tackle at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A lot of shiny orbs to find. This is a very straight forward collectathon with no  distractions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A fully original and varied soundtrack, with each world of the game having it's own ambient and dynamic songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/813ec476d12e952483f7307fb3362124.webp?t=1739746637\" width=615 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An ancient artefact has been tampered with and left in ruins. A lone hero is tasked by a mysterious occult with restoring it's power. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Of The Stars</strong> is a Momentum-based Collectathon. You play as Stoney, an explorer tasked with gathering all the Power Orbs. Jump, spin and bounce through a large variety of open-ended ethereal worlds to discover the secrets behind an ancient force which others seek to destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/4f08823ce172bcd0f4ed07cf2de8fdd5.webp?t=1739746637\" width=615 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0 Multiple playable characters - With varying stats and unique moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0 Simple and accessible controls - Whilst offering tons of movement tricks for more experienced players to take advantage of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A variety of worlds and locations to explore - From small sun-soaked islands to broad cityscapes to tackle at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A lot of shiny orbs to find. This is a very straight forward collectathon with no  distractions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410080/extras/5e345268a2616478e6ef78004041c1d6.webp?t=1739746637\" width=10 height=10 /></span>\u00a0A fully original and varied soundtrack, with each world of the game having it's own ambient and dynamic songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
